file tools/fixtures/index_row_bound_control.sh seventeen behaviors, the bound free at 192 and bitten at 193
file tools/in/index_row_bound_witness.rish the standing guard, 53rd on the roster
file session-logs/README.md 36 rows rewritten as pointers; the row rule seated in its header
file .claude/rules/session-logs.md the row rule, and the claim REDS %204 disproved corrected
file .claude/rules/stamp-and-name.md the byte bound follows from the fold AND the row, and the two-bound incompatibility named
file tools/fixtures/declared_ceiling_scan.sh byte ratchet 1 -> 0; no living page stands over its bound
file construction/REDS.md row %205 booked
recommend check-in (checkpoint) REDS %205 wants Keaton's word -- raise the pin bound for this one room, or lower the room bound, since 192 bytes carries a median day and 15 of 61 days ran past what the pin holds
